{"unit_id":"liuyu-f__dsh-plugin-session-cascade-delete#card-zh","repo":"liuyu-f/dsh-plugin-session-cascade-delete","commit":"e7525685d7b923aacee612ee7885d331705faed1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Cascade Session Delete 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话管理插件，在会话标题栏和侧栏菜单提供删除入口，并通过确认弹窗提交删除。它也注册 session_delete 工具，可按会话 ID 或唯一标题删除、列出会话或查看子代理树；删除运行中会话前会停止任务，默认逐层删除其拥有的子代理，并更新会话列表。适合需要清理旧会话及其关联记录的 DSH 用户。配置可选择保留子代理；删除操作没有撤销功能。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:472-492","src/index.js:1043-1078","src/index.js:989-990"]}
{"unit_id":"liuyu-f__dsh-plugin-session-cascade-delete#card-en","repo":"liuyu-f/dsh-plugin-session-cascade-delete","commit":"e7525685d7b923aacee612ee7885d331705faed1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Cascade Session Delete adds DSH web controls to delete sessions from the header or sidebar. Its session_delete tool deletes by ID or unique title, lists sessions, and shows subagent trees. Running sessions are stopped first; owned subagents are removed deepest-first by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:472-492","src/index.js:1043-1078"]}
